    "description": "NCEI Accession 0157469 includes chemical, discrete sample, physical and profile data collected from ATLANTIS in the North Atlantic Ocean from 2006-01-18 to 2006-01-31. These data include DISSOLVED OXYGEN, HYDROSTATIC PRESSURE, NITRATE, NITRITE, Potential temperature (theta), SALINITY, WATER TEMPERATURE, phosphate and silicate. The instruments used to collect these data include CTD and bottle.\n\nThese data were collected by Terrence M. Joyce of Woods Hole Oceanographic Institution as part of the CMDL2_33AT20060118 data set. CDIAC associated the following cruise ID(s) with this data set: AT013 and CMDL2",
